HTML Structure
Whenever we are creating the webpage we need to follow the html structure
<!DOCTYPE html> - This tell browser to use latest version of html. if we dont use many of the latest feature cant be used
<html></html> - All the content of the webpage should be present inside this
under html tage we have head and body tag
<head></head> - Used to store all the content not visible in html page ie the css style. in head section we can use title as well, whill set the title of the webpage
<title>HTML&CSS Review</title> - On tab it will show HTML&CSS Review
<body></body> - Need to keep all the content show in webpage
We can install liver server plugin, it will help us to show the change in realtime in browser and in setting on live server choose chrome and open .html file from vs code choose open with liver server, so it will show data in realtime
Eg:
